    "body": "The documentation for the 1100 can be found here: https://tormach.com/support/mill/1100mx-documents \n\nThere is a difference between the 1100 and the 1100mx is that the mx has different servos.\n\nIt's called 1100 because that's the max weight a lift gate truck could handle for residential deliveries.\n\nThe Operators Manual (at the link above) is really good about walking a newbie thru first use. If you spend a bit of time in https://hub.pathpilot.com/about then you'll be really comfortable once you get on the physical machine.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
