    "body": "claimed: mkinney (outside contributor, from fork mkinney/Camcraft) · 2026-11-07T22:07Z · branch issue/131-tormach-pathpilot · plan: a PathPilot (LinuxCNC-dialect) post plus a Tormach 770MX machine file, 3-axis first; MicroArc 4th axis as a follow-up issue\n\nTest machine (the contributor's own): Tormach 770MX (possibly the older 770M), inch programming, latest PathPilot, ATC, electronic tool setter (ETS), mister (M7), MicroArc 4th axis. Verification plan: posted programs checked in PathPilot Hub first, then dry run, air cut and a soft-material cut on the machine.",
