    "body": "PathPilot Hub v2.14.4 (simulator), first results on the 01-face sample:\n- \"Axis XY not specified by this or previous motions, end point will depend on current position (line 10)\": a real post issue. After G30, X and Y were unknown when the first move ran. Fixed in PR #162 (9cb46a6): the first move after each tool change is now preceded by `G0 X.. Y..` at the Z-up height, PathPilot's own XY-first order. Pinned by tormach_post::the_first_move_after_a_tool_change_positions_xy_with_z_up.\n- \"Program exceeds machine maximum on Y axis by 0.0572 in (line 0)\": not the post. The simulator's G54 Y was −1.3208, so the sample's Y 1.378 crossed +Y travel; the warning cleared once G54 was moved.\nRegenerated samples are being re-tested.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
