    "body": "First real GUI job (Face + 2D Contour on the 770MX) found two things:\n- The post was blocked by the machine check: \"40 limit problem(s) … the stroke is -336.550..0.000\". The 770MX file stated machine-style travel, but .mch travel is in program coordinates (relative to G54). Fixed in PR #162 (b189c96): full stroke each way. Pinned by tormach_post::a_face_job_on_the_built_in_770mx_passes_the_gate_and_posts_inch.\n- Tools have no number of their own, so T/H come from the tool's list position (T1 for a tool the shop knows as T31). Filed as #221.\nAlso found and filed along the way: #214 (fresh contour refused when G54 Z is on the part top), #215 (unreadable status line), #216 (create cells enabled with no stock).",
