    "body": "Status, with the remaining work split out at the reporter's request:\n- **Done:**\n  - the PathPilot post and the 770MX (PR #162);\n  - hardware runs on the contributor's 770MX (PathPilot 2.14.4), recorded above;\n  - tool numbers (#221);\n  - the other Tormach mills' machine files (#170).\n  - The Tormach lathe (#626) and plasma (#679) posts are merge-ready under their own issues.\n- **Split out:**\n  - **#785:** microARC 4 / 4th axis (A rotary in the machine file and the PathPilot post), with the Tormach owner's guides TD10749, TD10552 and TD10374 as sources.\n  - **#786:** a rigid-tapping capability, so G84 is refused on machines that can't rigid-tap (non-MX 770, R8).\n\nWith those two tracked, this umbrella can be closed as done.",
